# The reference subtitle files are compared byte for byte by the tests (tools/match_cuts/tests/test_captions.py):
# never convert their line ends. Git's Windows default (core.autocrlf true) would check them out with CRLF, and 11
# caption tests then fail on a fresh clone (Task 10).
srt/*.srt -text

# The Premiere preset (assets/premiere/*.prfpset) was saved by Premiere and checked byte for byte: kept as it is.
*.prfpset -text
